## Module-Wise API Details

### Assessment Module (`AssessmentController`)
- `GET /Assessment/{type}`: Entry point for assessment flow (consent and overview).
- `GET /Assessment/{type}/Questions`: Loads survey questions for the session.
- `GET /Assessment/{type}/SpeedTest`: Loads speed test UI and session state.
- `GET /Assessment/{type}/ImageAssessment`: Loads image rating view.
- `GET /Assessment/{type}/SortAssessment`: Loads sort assessment view.
- `GET /Assessment/{type}/ColorblindnessTest`: Loads Ishihara test view.
- `POST /Assessment/SubmitResponses`: Persists survey answers for a session.
- `POST /Assessment/SubmitImageQualityRating`: Stores a single image rating.
- `POST /Assessment/SubmitSortRatings`: Stores sort ratings with timing metrics.
- `POST /Assessment/SubmitColorblindnessResponses`: Stores color vision results.
- `GET /Assessment/GetSessionInfo`: Returns session progress state.
- `GET /Assessment/GetImageAssessmentProgress`: Returns image assessment progress.
- `GET /Assessment/GetColorblindnessImagesForTest`: Returns image list for Ishihara tests.

### Admin Module (`AdminController`)
- `POST /Admin/Login`: Authenticates admin users.
- `GET /Admin/Dashboard`: Loads analytics and admin overview.
- `POST /Admin/SaveContent`: Creates or updates assessment instructions.
- `POST /Admin/DeleteContent`: Removes assessment content.
- `POST /Admin/SaveQuestion`: Creates or updates a survey question.
- `POST /Admin/DeleteQuestion`: Deletes a survey question.
- `POST /Admin/UploadImages`: Uploads images and stores metadata.
- `GET /Admin/DownloadQuestionAnswersExcel`: Exports question responses.
- `GET /Admin/DownloadSpeedTestLogsExcel`: Exports speed test logs.

### Home Module (`HomeController`)
- `GET /`: Redirects to the application landing page.
- `GET /Home/Error`: Error display page for unhandled exceptions.

